{
    "title": "BFGoodrich OnTrail",
    "description": "UNLOCK BEYOND with BFGOODRICH ONTRAIL!\r\n\r\nCreated by BFGOODRICH TIRES, BFGoodrich OnTrail is an off-road GPS mapping and navigation app, and so much more! Designed to make off-roading easier, safer, and more fun! With over 40 years of off-road experience, BFGoodrich Tires has the off-road experts you can trust!\r\n\r\nAligned with our company\u2019s purpose, BFGoodrich OnTrail is all about the community, and being a valuable part of the off-roading world. We\u2019re giving access to thousands of public and exclusive professional trails with our BASIC (FREE) membership, no credit card required, no in-app purchase, no trial period. Use them online or download for offline use.\r\n\r\nAnd BFGoodrich OnTrail doesn\u2019t just have off-road and overlanding trail mapping, we also have other features to have fun and earn reward points. Use our Academy to learn how to off-road safely. Complete Missions to challenge yourself. Try Games like Scavenger Hunts. Find off-road Event and Park information.\r\n\r\nUse reward points to get chances to win a set of BFGoodrich tires or other BFGoodrich swag in our sweepstakes**, plus every membership also gets access to a TIRE REBATE* up to $125 via reward card on a set of four BFGoodrich tires!\r\n\r\nSo go ahead and download BFGOODRICH ONTRAIL today and be a part of a growing community of off-roaders, committed to unlocking the world around them! You have nothing to lose and everything to gain!\r\n\r\n\r\nDETAILS\r\n\r\nPUBLIC FEDERAL & STATE TRAILS sourced from\r\n- USFS Trails & Motor Roads (MVUM)\r\n- BLM Trails & Roads\r\n- Nevada OHV Program Trails\r\n- MDNR Off-Road vehicle Trails & Routes\r\n- USACE Off-Road Vehicle Areas\r\n\r\nEXCLUSIVE PROFESSIONAL CARTOGRAPHIC TRAILS recorded using high-precision professional GPS equipment ($400 value) sourced from\r\n- CartoTracks Trails\r\n- CartoTracks Off-Road Parks (BASIC+ & PREMIUM only)\r\n\r\nCROWDSOURCED TRAILS sourced from\r\n- Our community of enthusiasts\r\n\r\nFIND OFF-ROAD TRAILS NEAR YOU:\r\n- See Nearby or Featured trails, filter by vehicle type (4\u00d74, ATV, OHV, Dirt Bike \u2026), Difficulty and more\r\n- Check the weather forecast to understand the conditions\r\n- Download trails for OFFLINE use in case of no cell service (BASIC 5 at a time, BASIC+ 10 at a time, PREMIUM unlimited)\r\n\r\nCREATE YOUR OWN TRAIL MAPS:\r\n- Manually create trails with snap to road\r\n- Upload GPX files or edit a previous recorded trip to create a trail\r\n- Use desktop or mobile, auto-sync between devices\r\n\r\nOFF-ROAD GPS NAVIGATION EVEN WHEN OFFLINE:\r\n- Visualize yourself on a trail with our real time GPS vehicle marker\r\n- View POIs and hazards marked on a trail\r\n- Choose the map to suit you, Off-road or Satellite\r\n\r\nTRACK AND RECORD OFF-ROAD TRAILS:\r\n- Live track speed, time, distance, altitude and pitch & roll to help monitor your angle of approach\r\n- Capture POIs, notes, photos, and videos from your trip\r\n- Auto-save to your Journal, auto-sync to your desktop\r\n\r\nCONNECT & SHARE TRAILS:\r\n- Publish your trail in OnTrail to help the community\r\n- Share a link to your trail on Social for everyone to view\r\n- Share your trip directly with specific family and friends\r\n\r\nLEARN AND GAIN EXPERIENCE:\r\n- Knowledge you can trust from a brand with off-road roots\r\n- Learn from our Ultimate 4x4 Driving Guide off-road manual\r\n- Tap into pro off-roaders skills, apply them to your driving\r\n\r\nACTIVITIES & REWARDS:\r\n- Complete missions, view events, play games, have fun!\r\n- Earn rewards as you go and use them to enter our Sweepstakes**\r\n- Tire Rebate* up to $125 via reward card on a set of four BFGoodrich tires\r\n\r\n\r\nTERMS AND CONDITIONS:\r\n- Terms of Use: https://app.ontrail.bfgoodrich.com/on-trail/legal/termsofuse/\r\n- *Rebate Terms and Conditions: https://app.ontrail.bfgoodrich.com/on-trail/legal/rebate2/. Void where prohibited.\r\n- ** Sweepstakes Rules in each Sweepstakes tab in the App\r\n\r\nWE'RE HERE TO HELP!\r\nHave questions about OnTrail or off-roading in general? Have suggestions or comments? We'd love to hear them! You can contact us at BFGoodrichOnTrailSupport@BFGoodrich.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "UNLOCK BEYOND with BFGOODRICH ONTRAIL!<br><br>Created by BFGOODRICH TIRES, BFGoodrich OnTrail is an off-road GPS mapping and navigation app, and so much more! Designed to make off-roading easier, safer, and more fun! With over 40 years of off-road experience, BFGoodrich Tires has the off-road experts you can trust!<br><br>Aligned with our company\u2019s purpose, BFGoodrich OnTrail is all about the community, and being a valuable part of the off-roading world. We\u2019re giving access to thousands of public and exclusive professional trails with our BASIC (FREE) membership, no credit card required, no in-app purchase, no trial period. Use them online or download for offline use.<br><br>And BFGoodrich OnTrail doesn\u2019t just have off-road and overlanding trail mapping, we also have other features to have fun and earn reward points. Use our Academy to learn how to off-road safely. Complete Missions to challenge yourself. Try Games like Scavenger Hunts. Find off-road Event and Park information.<br><br>Use reward points to get chances to win a set of BFGoodrich tires or other BFGoodrich swag in our sweepstakes**, plus every membership also gets access to a TIRE REBATE* up to $125 via reward card on a set of four BFGoodrich tires!<br><br>So go ahead and download BFGOODRICH ONTRAIL today and be a part of a growing community of off-roaders, committed to unlocking the world around them! You have nothing to lose and everything to gain!<br><br><br>DETAILS<br><br>PUBLIC FEDERAL &amp; STATE TRAILS sourced from<br>- USFS Trails &amp; Motor Roads (MVUM)<br>- BLM Trails &amp; Roads<br>- Nevada OHV Program Trails<br>- MDNR Off-Road vehicle Trails &amp; Routes<br>- USACE Off-Road Vehicle Areas<br><br>EXCLUSIVE PROFESSIONAL CARTOGRAPHIC TRAILS recorded using high-precision professional GPS equipment ($400 value) sourced from<br>- CartoTracks Trails<br>- CartoTracks Off-Road Parks (BASIC+ &amp; PREMIUM only)<br><br>CROWDSOURCED TRAILS sourced from<br>- Our community of enthusiasts<br><br>FIND OFF-ROAD TRAILS NEAR YOU:<br>- See Nearby or Featured trails, filter by vehicle type (4\u00d74, ATV, OHV, Dirt Bike \u2026), Difficulty and more<br>- Check the weather forecast to understand the conditions<br>- Download trails for OFFLINE use in case of no cell service (BASIC 5 at a time, BASIC+ 10 at a time, PREMIUM unlimited)<br><br>CREATE YOUR OWN TRAIL MAPS:<br>- Manually create trails with snap to road<br>- Upload GPX files or edit a previous recorded trip to create a trail<br>- Use desktop or mobile, auto-sync between devices<br><br>OFF-ROAD GPS NAVIGATION EVEN WHEN OFFLINE:<br>- Visualize yourself on a trail with our real time GPS vehicle marker<br>- View POIs and hazards marked on a trail<br>- Choose the map to suit you, Off-road or Satellite<br><br>TRACK AND RECORD OFF-ROAD TRAILS:<br>- Live track speed, time, distance, altitude and pitch &amp; roll to help monitor your angle of approach<br>- Capture POIs, notes, photos, and videos from your trip<br>- Auto-save to your Journal, auto-sync to your desktop<br><br>CONNECT &amp; SHARE TRAILS:<br>- Publish your trail in OnTrail to help the community<br>- Share a link to your trail on Social for everyone to view<br>- Share your trip directly with specific family and friends<br><br>LEARN AND GAIN EXPERIENCE:<br>- Knowledge you can trust from a brand with off-road roots<br>- Learn from our Ultimate 4x4 Driving Guide off-road manual<br>- Tap into pro off-roaders skills, apply them to your driving<br><br>ACTIVITIES &amp; REWARDS:<br>- Complete missions, view events, play games, have fun!<br>- Earn rewards as you go and use them to enter our Sweepstakes**<br>- Tire Rebate* up to $125 via reward card on a set of four BFGoodrich tires<br><br><br>TERMS AND CONDITIONS:<br>- Terms of Use: https://app.ontrail.bfgoodrich.com/on-trail/legal/termsofuse/<br>- *Rebate Terms and Conditions: https://app.ontrail.bfgoodrich.com/on-trail/legal/rebate2/. Void where prohibited.<br>- ** Sweepstakes Rules in each Sweepstakes tab in the App<br><br>WE&#39;RE HERE TO HELP!<br>Have questions about OnTrail or off-roading in general? Have suggestions or comments? We&#39;d love to hear them! You can contact us at BFGoodrichOnTrailSupport@BFGoodrich.com",
